{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"d077bf22a55c1d693a0afea16dbf1151bd94188cf5efe0270c0db50666edd440","ja":"琴葉のキュンなお仕事","zh":"琴叶的心动工作","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"3d6cc684046d60976afca7797b7807548bd63f265bffe2bd5c37d8b4adcab550","ja":"あっ、おはよう、亜利沙。ちょうどよかった。\nお願いしたいことがあるんだけど……。","zh":"啊，早啊，亚利沙。正好。\n我有件事想拜托你……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"eac9ecbaddeb119974024c7603204561b4a839c43507daeaba9983c13df517eb","ja":"おはようございます、琴葉ちゃん！\nありさでよければ、なんでも言ってくださいっ！","zh":"早上好，琴叶！\n只要亚利沙能帮上忙，什么都可以跟我说哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e2151a4c6e62131faf94833658cd2439876e1dcb92676f255e693d7995ba7eb6","ja":"ありがとう。あのね、私、今度このボイスドラマに、\n男の子役で出演できることになったの。","zh":"谢谢。那个啊，我下次要在这部广播剧里\n出演一个男孩子的角色了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1ab918fa29fa26f0abf4a8d6c15fbf17181e55da864feec575caf41179918a4b","ja":"この台本ですか？　ふんふん、琴葉ちゃんの役は、\n実は主人公ちゃんに一途なチャラ男……。","zh":"是这个剧本吗？嗯嗯，琴叶演的角色，\n实际上是一心一意喜欢女主角的轻浮男……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"40224185983c26551ec5e00cf066d425b09dfca2d6f9cf55ef7b08e9ebd2094e","ja":"チャラ男ですか～～～っ！？","zh":"是轻浮男吗～～～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"471561465a229588b38f1233c0fdd8be723b180ed001700ce590765aa350a673","ja":"うん。感謝祭でもチャンスがあったけど、私、\nこういう演技ももっと上手くできるようになりたくて！","zh":"嗯。虽然感谢祭时也有过机会，但我，\n也想在这样的表演上变得更加熟练！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"fa5badd8f8c4567b040d3c2f98d30a03f33a26e51eb52148b0866c1893e219cc","ja":"台本読みをするから、それで感じたことを\n自由に言ってもらいたいの。いいかな？","zh":"我们要读剧本，之后想请你自由说说\n自己的感受。可以吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"6c0d923b88f87052750fd72da7c50afd31ab10dd930d3df8eb8fa0836e5652aa","ja":"ぜひぜひ、お手伝いさせてください！\n琴葉ちゃんに頼ってもらえるなんて、光栄です～！","zh":"一定要让我来帮忙！\n能被琴叶依靠，真是太荣幸了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"2159c736cf4bbbce54e6cf9453875f1319a54376f46d80637784d264d1569448","ja":"ありがとう！　それじゃあ、さっそく始めるね……。","zh":"谢谢！那么，这就开始吧……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"1a3b041f2f6a912956f7f393da37e2e4ffb5e96c6aebbea8b94d2c8ad587cbd7","ja":"「おはよっ。みんな、今日もサイコーにカワイイな！」","zh":"「早上好。大家今天也超级可爱呢！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"9dff1ee32e952e720bdee17e47e65e3a72c95351f5fc514ec9e9ebb1937da3b1","ja":"ふおぉぉ～っ！　こ、こんな素敵な笑顔で\n褒められたら、ドキドキが止まりません～！","zh":"哇啊啊～！被、被这么灿烂的笑容\n夸奖的话，心跳根本停不下来～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"1ac02f36b78c4b1c8e4afa518e13ab697781f76ecc6967e25fc73767028a4737","ja":"「なあ、オレに付き合えよ。勉強なんかより、\n最高に刺激的な時間を味わわせてやるからさ？」","zh":"“喂，陪陪我嘛。比起学习什么的，\n我能让你体会到绝顶刺激的时光哦？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"814b2b373bf78ea0904901bc00339207f0061b012fe621c3e8a575cda80a31c4","ja":"はうっ！　チャラさの中に、ちょい悪な気配漂う\nニヒルな微笑！　これは、キュンです……！","zh":"哈呜！　轻浮之中隐约透着一丝坏坏的气息，\n虚无的微笑！　这真是，让人心动不已……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"39ed220ae085aa05ab8ba89936f0d016a3cb81fb0ffbf1c7017e9f58e09a262f","ja":"「だ～か～ら～。オレにしとけって。なっ？\nキミもオレのこと……ケッコー気になってるっしょ♪」","zh":"“所～以～说～，选我不就好了嘛。对吧？\n你其实也……挺在意我的吧♪”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"22ad2c299117009256dee78491b5d1c9a042bfade67a74444b83e212af58a28a","ja":"はい喜んで！　もう、もう……ありさは\nあなた様にぞっこんです～～～～！！","zh":"我很乐意！真是的，真是的……亚利沙\n已经深深迷上您了～～～～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1544.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"d75d2547d394ed56cacee8220a44dd2245e7ac4a2d37b5d955010f42fd6c1535","ja":"はぁ、はぁ……と、とっても幸せですが……。\nあ、ありさの心臓、もたないかも……ぜぇ、ぜぇ……。","zh":"哈啊，哈啊……好、好幸福啊……\n亚、亚利沙的心脏快要承受不住了……呼，呼……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
